; Anomaly Coop - economy group (W4): file-local tables made reachable as module fields (modded exes
; unlocalizer, see unlocalizer_modded_exes_bind_item.ltx for the rules). Sections merge with other
; unlocalizer files; bind_item item_uses / item_condition are already unlocalized by modded exes.

; scripts\coop_economy_world.script: the host applies a client's pickup of a game_setup world item (loot spot,
; next world item, map mark) and writes the rolled condition / ammo / uses onto the item before anybody takes it.
[game_setup]
world_itm_info
world_itm_off
world_itm_num
world_itm_on
limited_uses

; Same, for devices: their condition is also kept in item_device's own table.
[item_device]
dev_condition
